        (text "DriveMCU / 센서 및 수동 조작" (at 18 18 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "909712cb-9f3c-5d72-a68b-107e4abb4d7a")) (text "공유 I2C: SDA GPIO22 / SCL GPIO23 · GPS: UART2 9600 8N1" (at 18 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.65 1.65)) (justify left)) (uuid "c49e5cd3-a8e9-5fc3-9f9c-24aa07ac4c92")) (text "ARD / LEGACY FIRMWARE  |  2026.10.17  |  MODULE INTERCONNECT" (at 18 10 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "664ebe5b-5c0d-5966-b0cd-3b4d75c8ad23")) (text "읽는 법: 같은 이름의 신호 라벨은 전기적으로 연결됨. 핀 번호는 GPIO/신호명이며 커넥터 순번이 아님." (at 18 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "03a496d9-2acc-5d45-9d43-2256a0f21817")) (text "I2C 주소: SSD1306 0x3C, AHT20 0x38, BMP280 0x76 → 0x77 순서 탐색, VL53L0X 라이브러리 기본 주소." (at 18 255 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "3345822a-44b5-55c1-b3cd-fe611f4d4875")) (text "VL53L0X는 ARD_ENABLE_TOF=0으로 기본 비활성. GPS 파싱도 enableGPS=false가 기본이며 명령으로 활성화." (at 18 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "76b287f4-96f0-5a09-b25c-2d10fa8d81ea")) (text "버튼 GND, 가변저항 3.3V/GND, 버저 구동 방식, I2C 풀업 및 각 모듈 전원 전압은 실물 확인 필요." (at 18 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "39be23ae-338e-5fd5-8394-91589a1820c2")) (wire (pts (xy 92.71 121.92) (xy 102.87 121.92)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "080693b1-e41b-553b-aa91-fccc1b99c730")) (label "D_G4" (at 102.87 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b309fd37-13a6-5574-b315-c1d910fc4c5f")) (wire (pts (xy 92.71 127.0) (xy 102.87 127.0)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "3a2cdda6-5130-5496-b975-081ee7c783c2")) (label "D_G13" (at 102.87 127.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "160b2cd2-f792-562b-bbbe-cc13083a2ee0")) (wire (pts (xy 92.71 132.08) (xy 102.87 132.08)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "8d5bbd4e-1c39-50c6-b576-4cce19a54b13")) (label "D_G14" (at 102.87 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid